rem mapList.append <mapname> gpm_cq <size>
rem 128 = Tiny (smallest). 16 = Small. 32 = Medium. 64 = Big.
rem Only Conquest layers that exist in each map. No 32: operation_hyacinth, tunis_1943.
rem Firing range maps were removed.

rem |-------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
rem |  Conquest - Tiny - 128 (smallest layouts)
rem |-------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
